column2:
Behold, O Goddess, great Queen, leader of the circle of the staff: the army of Shaktis, charming in form, has been satisfied by me.
brahmandpuran:140:82	Some dance and sing, their girdles jingling sweetly; some clap their hands before those who dance;
brahmandpuran:140:83	some laugh, their lovely breasts heaving; some, languid with bliss, fall upon one another's limbs;
brahmandpuran:140:84	some leap about, their girdles and garments slipping from their hips; some, rising up armed yet without weapons, reel about.
